{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act11mini_level_act11mini_st04",
  "groupId": "act11mini",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "再见罗伊",
  "storyCode": "",
  "avgTag": "幕间",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act11mini/level_act11mini_st04.txt",
  "sourceHash": "89e58ef689eb828d6e36d2520d2006ceabf1e93410ef40af74dc10ae77acf20f",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "你问我，我加入无胄盟的理由？\n奇怪，这是老头你的组织，我加入还需要什么理由啊。\n所以这算是面试吗？我听说城里的企业都搞这一套，我们以后再招新人也要这么来吗？那我是不是该喊你老板？\n哎，你别嫌烦啊。\n按我看，杀手组织和企业也没什么不一样的，反正都是上班，然后加班，还有安排其他人加班。\n真要说个跟着干的理由，那肯定还是赚的钱够多吧，比我自己打猎杀羽兽多赚不是一点半点。\n反正一样都是瞄准——射击，那当然是赚得多的活更让人有干劲啊。\n是吧老板，毕竟大家都是想要过上好日子的嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血骑士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_214_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "无胄盟的杀手，你们是怎么查到这里的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_208_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "事到如今还问这种问题？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_209_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "血骑士这样的名人，自然一举一动都有人关注了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_209_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "虽然阁下已经足够小心，但......这么说吧，能查到这里的人可不止是我们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血骑士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_214_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_209_1#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "要找您麻烦的人可不少，我们能赶在第一个找到您，可是费了不少功夫啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_209_1#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "时间紧迫，还请您相信我们的诚意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血骑士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_214_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......相信你们？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血骑士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_214_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "笑话，无胄盟也配与我谈信任吗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_209_1#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "必要的时候，我们可以不是无胄盟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_208_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血骑士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_214_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......杀手，这就是你们放任自己的手下被我杀死的理由？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血骑士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_214_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你们是想——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_209_1#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嘘，看破不说破。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_209_1#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "血骑士阁下一直是个聪明人，应该不会不懂这个道理。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血骑士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_214_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_209_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "帮我们一个小小的忙，也给自己一个脱身的机会，这应该是一笔很划算的买卖。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_209_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这样对我们双方都好......你说是吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "无胄盟的青金大位，怎么样，听起来够厉害的吧？\n实际上赚的也确实够多。某种意义上来说，和竞技骑士差不了多少，都是拿命拼来的钱。\n想要来钱快，那多少得付出点代价，承担点风险不是？\n不过呢，干这行十多年，差不多也做到头了。\n急流勇退啊，最简单的道理，何必要逆着这个时代的洪流这么挣扎？有更安稳的生财法子，何苦再这么拼命呢？\n看准了时机，该上岸还是得上岸。\n给人打工，哪有自己做老板来得舒服？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "手术定在两个小时后，记得准点到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "明天之后你就只有约尔·泰勒这一个身份，公司那边再过两天会让我们露个脸，别出岔子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "还有......联合会的人看起来还没完全相信我们和血骑士同归于尽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啧，那边调查的人还没完全撤走，不过无胄盟倒是已经定好新的青金人选了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "总之在事情完全解决之前，少在外头露面，省得节外生枝......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......喂，你听见没有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_543_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯？啊我在听，我在听。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_543_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "老板，麻烦给我来个最贵的套餐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_543_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "直接吃不用包上，多加辣！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_543_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哎，莫妮克阁下，你刚刚说什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......去死吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_543_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那可不行，我要是死了，可怜的泰勒太太可就要直接成为寡......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_543_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......嗯，挂得真快。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_543_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（看来一切都还算顺利，董事会就算现在有怀疑，也早就迟了。血骑士......他如果够聪明，就不会这个时候跳出来搅局。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_543_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（况且人人自顾不暇，几个“道具”的损失而已，谁都不会太在意。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_543_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（玄铁那应该轮不着我去担心，剩下的就是换张脸，换个身份......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_543_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_543_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（马上就要和这张脸说拜拜了啊。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_543_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（不知道新面容顺不顺眼，不过不管怎么说，应该都是不可能再像现在这么帅了。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_543_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（哎。可惜。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "曾经的青金大位站在街道上，将自己隐藏在霓虹灯的阴影之下。\n他抬手拍了拍自己的脸颊，视线漫无目的地扫过城市光鲜亮丽的街道。\n商业楼外侧的大屏幕上正播放着近期最受关注的新闻要点。\n整条街道上大大小小的屏幕似乎都播报着相似的内容，噪音与繁杂的屏幕光线让人略微晕眩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "电视",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "血骑士在乡村的隐居处遭遇不明人士袭击，现场有激烈打斗痕迹，现已确认现场残留的血迹归属为血骑士本人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "电视",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "现场同时发现了大量袭击者遗体。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "电视",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "专家指出，在这样激烈的战斗之中，血骑士幸存的可能性非常微小，而残存的大量血迹也佐证了这一推断。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "电视",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "目前最合理的解释是我们的前任冠军在败给归来的耀骑士后，耗尽了最后的力量，与袭击者同归于尽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "电视",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "更多有关资讯，敬请关注我们的后续节目！直击血骑士受袭事件真相！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者骑士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_220",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "胡说！全都是在放屁！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者骑士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_220",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "血骑士怎么可能被区区杀手杀死，这不可能！他一定是受了伤，所以才不愿意出现在那群只会抢新闻吸血的媒体面前......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者骑士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_220",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "卑鄙无耻的暗杀者！一群阴沟里的臭虫！血骑士绝不会就这么倒下！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企业员工",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_223",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "等一下，你说就说，能不能别乱挥手......哎我的脑袋！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者骑士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_220",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......哎！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者骑士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_220",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "对、对不住，是我太激动了，你没事吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企业员工",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_223",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嘶......算我倒霉......算了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企业员工",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_223",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那边那位老兄，你没被砸到吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_543_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企业员工",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_223",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "兄弟？没事吧？该不会真的被砸到脑袋了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_543_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯......嗯？不好意思，啊，是在问我吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企业员工",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_223",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "半夜还蹲在这种地方买路边摊的就我们三个。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_543_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "说得也是。啊呀，多谢关心，我没什么事，只是听着刚刚的新闻有点入神。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者骑士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_220",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "新闻全都是狗屎！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者骑士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_220",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这些闻着味舔血的蝇虫根本不关心血骑士的死活，他们根本什么都没搞明白，就敢胡说一气！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_543_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“被耀骑士击败后，曾经的冠军竟做出这种事！”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_543_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啧啧，只要取一个好的标题，好几天的点击量就轻松到手。任谁都会好奇地点进去瞄一眼，简直是这两天最新的财富密码啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者骑士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_220",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他不该被这么、这么......消费！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_543_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不错的用词，很准确。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企业员工",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_223",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们公司和骑士竞技有部分关联产业，我跟着跑项目的时候还见过那位几次，这几天新闻一出，我们手上的项目直接就黄了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企业员工",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_223",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哎......我本人还挺喜欢血骑士的，希望他能没事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者骑士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_220",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......哼，就冲你这句话，我就该请你喝一杯！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企业员工",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_223",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者骑士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_220",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "当是刚才的赔礼了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者骑士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_220",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "怎么样，我这样的感染者请的酒，敢来吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企业员工",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_223",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我明天还要上班......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企业员工",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_223",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企业员工",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_223",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "算了，明天的事明天再说。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企业员工",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_223",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "去哪，你带路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者骑士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_220",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "胆子真大......那你呢，一起去不？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_543_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "也邀请我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_543_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "其实我一会还有点事儿要办——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_543_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......不过相逢就是有缘，盛情难却，走走走，去哪儿喝？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者骑士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_220",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "行，你们跟我来！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_543_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呼哈，干杯！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企业员工",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_223",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "干！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者骑士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_220",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......你们俩，差不多得了。我没带多少钱出门。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企业员工",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_223",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "其实我，嗯，认得你，你是今天比赛的那个，那个......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企业员工",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_223",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "铁腕骑士！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企业员工",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_223",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我被铁腕骑士的铁腕砸了脑袋......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_543_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈哈哈哈！还真是这么回事！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者骑士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_220",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "咳，我道过歉了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企业员工",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_223",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哎！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企业员工",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_223",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "今天真是可惜了，就差一点点就能赢，要是对面没有那个补给包的话你就能赢了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企业员工",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_223",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我押了你赢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者骑士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_220",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......你押了我？为什么会押我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企业员工",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_223",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "因为赔率高。不然呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者骑士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_220",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......嗯......那确实......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者骑士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_220",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不过下回你就知道了，大多数时候都别押我们这种感染者骑士，他们不会让我们赢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者骑士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_220",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我拼了一把，但还是失败了。恐怕这回幕后的那些家伙要看我更不顺眼了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_543_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哇哦，听起来真可怕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者骑士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_220",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "要是我有血骑士的本事......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_543_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他不也输给那个耀骑士了？啊，对不住，是不是不该提这个。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者骑士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_220",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者骑士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_220",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "说起来，老兄你又是什么人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企业员工",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_223",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "该不会也是什么骑士吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_543_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "没有的事，我就是个刚来大城市的乡下猎人，平时猎猎羽兽，偶尔能卖出个好价钱就算是赚了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_543_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不过现在日子不好过了，就想着能不能来城里赚一笔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企业员工",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_223",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "比如当个竞技骑士？能赢的话赚得又多又快。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_543_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯，这个就算了吧，我哪有本事和骑士老爷们比。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_543_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "打打杀杀的事情我不擅长的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者骑士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_220",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你倒是精明。别看骑士竞技那么光鲜，真正赚到钱的骑士，也就那么一小撮，我劝你还是别动这方面的心思。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者骑士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_220",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我要不是没其他路可选，也不会干这行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_543_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "世事难料啊，老兄。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者骑士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_220",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是啊，那时候也不过是想着在城市里能过得更好点......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者骑士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_220",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "要是有那么个机会，真想回去告诉几年前的自己，别来什么大骑士领，就乖乖留在家里干活。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者骑士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_220",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "一辈子种地都好......总比现在强。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企业员工",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_223",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "能赚到钱的总是少数，我赞成。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企业员工",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_223",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "竞技骑士能赚的，和背后企业能拿到的真正的利润相比，根本就不算什么......嗝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_543_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你醉了，兄弟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企业员工",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_223",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "没有，我好得很！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企业员工",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_223",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你们说......是不是我要是感染了，明天就不用上班了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者骑士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_220",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_543_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那确实。不仅明天，不出意外今后你应该就再也不用上班了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企业员工",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_223",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "算了当我什么都没说......嗝，哎，我好像真的醉了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企业员工",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_223",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "抱歉，我昏头了，我实在......昏头了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者骑士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_220",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "没事。能看出来你确实不舒服，所以目前我还能忍得住不揍你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者骑士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_220",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "别拿这种事开玩笑......认真的，再被我听到一次，今晚你就得去医院接鼻梁骨了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企业员工",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_223",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唉......不说了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企业员工",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_223",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "说句实话，其实我小的时候一直想当骑士来着。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企业员工",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_223",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不是竞技骑士，是更古老一点的......我爷爷那一辈人喜欢的那种。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_543_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你是指前阵子进城的那些征战骑士老爷？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企业员工",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_223",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我知道我没这个本领......唉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_543_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "看开一点。这些打打杀杀的都过时了，单靠逞凶斗狠能拼出的结果就那么点......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者骑士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_220",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "谁说不是呢。但我们......不拼，也得拼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者骑士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_220",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呼......老板，再来一杯酒！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_543_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "按我说，大家都想日子能过得好点，最好是能进个企业什么的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企业员工",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_223",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你想进企业？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_543_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我，嗯，算是吧。最好是个大企业，能坐办公室上班那种。哎不过当销售也行，我觉得我还挺擅长的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_543_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "听说大企业还给优秀员工奖金分红，能安安稳稳拿年薪，多好！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者骑士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_220",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈哈，听起来是不错......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企业员工",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_223",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......天真！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_543_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呃？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企业员工",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_223",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在大企业干活可没有你们想的那么简单......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_543_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯......这个嘛，我也就是做做梦，大家都知道想进企业不容易。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企业员工",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_223",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "想进是不容易，但这也是最简单的一步，进去只不过是个开始。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企业员工",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_223",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "等你真正进去了，往往就走不掉了，这才是难......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企业员工",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_223",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企业员工",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_223",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我今天......其实旷工了，没去上班。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企业员工",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_223",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "本来想请个假，但今年已经没假期余额了，所以干脆没请。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_543_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "消失一整天，没人给你打电话？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企业员工",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_223",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "电话没电了。昨晚忘了充。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_543_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好家伙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者骑士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_220",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你这样......真的没问题吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企业员工",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_223",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "有问题，问题还挺大。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者骑士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_220",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......那你也太坦然了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企业员工",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_223",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈......哈哈，我算坦然吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企业员工",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_223",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我现在舌头是麻的，胃是空的，脑子大概和这两者相加差不多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企业员工",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_223",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哦刚刚喝了酒，胃里有酒，脑袋里有水。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者骑士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_220",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "什么乱七八糟的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_543_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我还蛮喜欢这个比喻的，别致。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企业员工",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_223",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不管怎么说，我现在觉得也挺好的，听不见铃声......至少可以假装一切都没问题。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_543_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "恕我直言，那也只是现在，一时清净而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_543_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "等你给电话充上电......嘶，真有点不敢想。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企业员工",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_223",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......别说了，我忽然觉得浑身发冷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者骑士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_220",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "连我都开始觉得胃不舒服了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企业员工",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_223",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "随便吧，我看开了。我这样的员工要多少有多少，能力强的老员工和干劲足的新人公司都不缺，耽误不了什么事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企业员工",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_223",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我就是累了......想休一天，什么都不管的那种休假。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企业员工",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_223",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "要是真因为这事就被裁，那也行，也省得我自己总是下不了决心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_543_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "真这么坦然？真不怕？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企业员工",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_223",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......开玩笑的，当然怕，房子的贷款还没还多少呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企业员工",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_223",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所以我打算这就回家通宵写检讨，明天交给部长，就说我重病昏迷了一天，电话不小心摔坏了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_543_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唔，有点假。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者骑士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_220",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "相当假！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企业员工",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_223",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "真不真假不假无所谓，大家有个台阶下就行......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企业员工",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_223",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "行了，今天就到此为止吧，都别喝了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者骑士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_220",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "老板，结账......嘶，你们还真不客气，都挑贵的喝啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_543_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "多谢款待。哎呀，好不容易进城一次，又有朋友仗义请客，机会难得。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_543_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_543_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "看在今晚的酒的分上，给你个建议。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者骑士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_220",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "给我什么建议？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_543_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你今晚要不就在酒吧待着，我看了看，这里通宵营业，客人不少。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_543_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "等到白天了，再找个人多的地方......总之尽量往人群里走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企业员工",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_223",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊？什么意思？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_543_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "就这样，我先告辞了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企业员工",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_223",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他就这么走了？也不解释一下......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企业员工",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_223",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "欸，我也该回家了。你打算怎么办？真的要听那家伙说的，喝通宵？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者骑士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_220",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "老头后来告诉我，他是玄铁，看我应该可以做个青金。\n他是够黑够硬的，但我寻思着我也不青啊。唉，不能和老板计较，青金就青金吧。\n老头刚捡着我的时候——其实不能这么说，因为我一个人活得挺好，本来也不需要被捡。\n总之那时候我刚猎了两只羽兽，烫掉毛，放干血，就能在生好的火堆上烤来吃。\n结果好嘛，这老头直接吃了一只半，就留了两个头，一对爪子，还有一条大腿肉给我。\n吃完他就和那种故事里的高人似的，开口就说：\n你这个年纪，没人教，没工具，却能猎到这种精于闪躲，老练猎人都难猎到的羽兽，算是很有天赋了。\n怎么样，小孩，你想过上好日子吗？\n——我想啊。怎么能不想。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者骑士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_220",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者骑士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_220",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我也是昏头了，竟然真的信了那人的话，耽搁了这么久。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者骑士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_220",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "都快要天亮了......还是回去吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者骑士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_220",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嘶......好冷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者骑士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_220",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "原来这个点的大骑士领是这个样子，半个人都没有，只有满地还没打扫的垃圾和被随便丢掉的骑士海报......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者骑士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_220",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈，大家都是垃圾......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者骑士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_220",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——什么人？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者骑士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_220",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你们是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "无胄盟杀手",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_216",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "铁腕骑士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "无胄盟杀手",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_216",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "拒不与联合会合作，你挡了别人的路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "无胄盟杀手",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_216",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "血骑士已经没法再护着你们了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "给他们卖命，时间越长，我看得就越清楚。\n骑士是他们货仓里囤积的商品，杀手是他们手底下拿捏的武器，舆论？舆论是最好操控的，他们已经把这些都研究透了。\n资金，权力，在卡西米尔，这两样往往被绑在一起。\n哎，我倒也不是说就一定想当大富豪，只是你看看，想要日子过得更好，就还是得挤进那群人里才行。\n大多数人就这么一层一层往上爬，可哪里又能有不被掌控的自由？\n所以别想太多，有条件呢，就尽量让自己过得更好一点，更舒服一点......\n至少从今往后，我不必再被一通电话要求去杀谁，万一失误，可能受伤不说，还要费心思糊弄老板，是吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好了，你的脸没问题了，睁眼吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你再这么做作地摸脸我会揍你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哎，别啊，莫妮克阁下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "脸上全是绷带的感觉有点，嗯，新鲜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唐娜。唐娜·泰勒。你是约尔·泰勒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "唐娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "等会医生回来，别喊错了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "约尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊，那称呼也得变一变了。我们是夫妻，是吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "唐娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "约尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你害羞了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "唐娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你眼瞎了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "约尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "别这么凶嘛，虽然说这安排是有点......嗯，不过也可以啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "约尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "而且我觉得你这张脸还是很漂亮的，放心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "唐娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......你眼瞎了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医生",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你醒了，适应得怎么样？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医生",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你选择的是加急的项目，虽然源石技艺可以加速这个过程，不需要长期分次进行手术，但对应的风险还是有的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医生",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "近期还不能拆掉绷带，之后最好是能一个月来进行一次后续保养，这样可以确保最大限度的稳定......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "约尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "谢谢，效果很好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "约尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不过后续保养就不劳操心了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医生",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呃......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "约尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们会自己想办法解决，辛苦了，医生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "唐娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "真干脆。尸体你自己想办法解决。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "约尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "没办法，这件事不能让任何人知道，虽然那句话俗了点，但说得一点没错......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "约尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "只有死人才能保守秘密。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "约尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "说起来，你知道联合会对一批追随血骑士的感染者骑士下手的事吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "约尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "昨晚碰到了一个，我稍微确认了一下......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "唐娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好像听过。但与我无关。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "唐娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "劝你也别多管，别忘了，现在我们和无胄盟没关系了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "约尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哎，这么说也没错。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "约尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "已经和我们无关了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "约尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好了，接下来就要开始新生活了啊，我们怎么办，做销售的话......真的要去跑业务吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "唐娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "就算你想跑，玄铁也不会同意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "唐娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你不把我们的客人赶跑就谢天谢地了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "约尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "搞不好我有这个才能呢？现在什么都有了，总得再给自己找点事情做吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "唐娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你很闲？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "约尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "有点，不然我们俩去打猎怎么样？去乡间买栋别墅，我教你猎羽兽，这事没人能比我更擅长了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "约尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "以前在树林里靠打猎为生的时候，可没想过会有这么出息的一天。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "约尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "之前是没这个空闲，现在可好，时间多得很，正好能好好过过瘾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "唐娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你闲得慌，你自己去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "唐娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我要休假，可能去多索雷斯或者汐斯塔，而不是什么乡下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "唐娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "费了这么多功夫，好不容易才有了今天，就是给你回味童年的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "唐娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你图什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "约尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......这个嘛，谁知道呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "约尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "能过得好一点就尽量过得好一点嘛，我没想那么多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "唐娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......啧，如果哪天你忽然脑子抽风要归隐山林，名下的财产不要了可以直接转给我。银行卡账号回头发你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "约尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈哈，按我们现在的身份，只要我哪天遭遇不测，遗产自然就归你了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "唐娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "有道理，就这么办吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "约尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "真无情。不聊这个了，等我处理完眼下的事，刚才提到的度假，怎么样，考虑一下？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "约尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——你说要去哪，我们一起拼个团？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
